Notebook[{
Cell["\<\

Assignment 2 Answering all of question 1 and the integral from question 2.

Q1. calculating the Kretschmann scalar in Schwarzschild space-time.

Use of Table[] to create the Riemann tensor done with reference to J. Hartle \
Mathematica notebook. \
https://web.physics.ucsb.edu/~gravitybook/math/curvature.pdf

Define the Schwarzschild metric.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.917180207573985*^9, {3.9171802430474987`*^9, 3.917180272262744*^9}, {
   3.917180455579731*^9, 3.9171805086367865`*^9}, {3.917184678796235*^9, 
   3.9171847166343803`*^9}, {3.9171847575191975`*^9, 
